Z||000000||theogre||08-17-2001||11:46 PM||||Has anyone else started turning off this mess?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  It used to be at least fun. Now it's just annoying. Vince seems to have missed the idea that WCW ratings were choking for air because WCW "talent"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif">  has none.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> What the hell is the point of a "spinaroonie"? At least the "Peoples Elbow" eventually got around to dropping an elbow...<P>Now the wombat Stuffenie McMahon-Helmsly buys boobs that make Lita look flat....   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> With her huge ass what was she thinking?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  <P>Then there's the on going Saga with Jerry "The king" Lawler...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> Let me get this right.... They hire WCW "Talent"   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif">  and and still say Jerry's wife is hard to deal with? At least she has beleivable acting skill. When she got grabbed by RTC it was reasonably beleivable that she didn't want to go....<P>We shut Smack Down off Thrusday. Maybe I should start following the ratings... I know I'll be watching a hell of allot less of it....<P>------------------<BR><I><B>Screamin Yellow Zonkers... If it's Screamin and Yellow, I ain't eatin it.</B></I><p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 08-17-2001).]||||reg||13
Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-17-2001||11:58 PM||||Yeah I remember a few months ago about Jerry Lawler. It was on the news here (because he lives here). He (Jerry) is back on local Memphis wrestling (on local WMC-TV Ch 5). He damn near started the Memphis wrestling scene in the 70's. He has been on it from time to time while on WWF, but since leaving hes on it every Sat morning here. Stacy (his wife) is <I>occasionally</I> on. They came on the local show right after it happened and explained the entire situation...Stacy was even crying...and I actually believe she was sincere (after all, she just got fired from the WWF).<BR>Jerry Lawler ran for mayor of Memphis last year.....he lost (but I voted for him    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) He lives about 5 minutes away from me to.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><P>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-18-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-18-2001).]||||reg||1
