Z||000006||theogre||08-18-2001||11:28 PM||||Hard to say about the name thing.... That ruling came after the "invasion" bs started. (It's World Wildlife whatever.... <A HREF="http://www.wwf.org)" TARGET=_blank>www.wwf.org)</A>  wwf.org didn't start the WIPO action untill wwf.com went global in the last couple years. McMahon's bunch has already said they are apealing the ruling. They have enough money to keep the thing tied up in courts for years.<P>domain disputes are only going to get worse in a major hurry. All the new TLDs are in dispute already over various trademark and other issues. I expect the registries to end up in federal court and WIPO actions in pretty short order.<P>Don't get me started on booger t.... him and his ebonislang.... His act is one of the most degrading things I've seen on TV in years. He's the first one I've seen in a long time where you wish he'd really get hurt enough to end his "sucka" career. what a Fing jackass....||||reg||1
